{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39659812",
      "title": "Deriving State From Props",
      "sourceHash": "55e717ac89a4a362456b1d697d2981b2ab1498ea25412c3fefddf76f57f44cb6",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.19,
          "end": 5.19,
          "en": "So now that we got this game turns state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.19,
          "end": 7.41,
          "en": "which we are updating here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.41,
          "end": 11.91,
          "en": "let's use this state to derive the gameboard",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.91,
          "end": 14.043,
          "en": "from that array of turns.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.09,
          "end": 18.06,
          "en": "And for that here on the Gameboard component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.06,
          "end": 21.63,
          "en": "we could pass a new turns prop to it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.63,
          "end": 23.82,
          "en": "Name of course is up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.82,
          "end": 25.92,
          "en": "And pass our game turns array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.92,
          "end": 29.013,
          "en": "as a value for this prop to Gameboard.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 31.14,
          "end": 33.96,
          "en": "And now in the Gameboard component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.96,
          "end": 38.61,
          "en": "we can and should expect this turns array here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 38.61,
          "end": 42.153,
          "en": "This turns prop, which will be that array of turns data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 42.99,
          "end": 45.48,
          "en": "And now we need to add some logic here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 45.48,
          "end": 50.48,
          "en": "to this gameboard component function to derive our gameboard",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 51.18,
          "end": 55.65,
          "en": "which still should be such an array full of arrays.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 55.65,
          "end": 60.65,
          "en": "So such a multi-dimensional array from this turns array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 61.83,
          "end": 65.43,
          "en": "So we need to transform this turns array into such an array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 65.43,
          "end": 70.26,
          "en": "And this sounds more complex than it is actually",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 70.26,
          "end": 72.45,
          "en": "because we can start quite simple.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 72.45,
          "end": 75.36,
          "en": "We can add a variable here called Gameboard",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 75.36,
          "end": 77.76,
          "en": "because we'll need that variable anyways.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 77.76,
          "end": 80.643,
          "en": "We are looking for it down here after all.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 82.2,
          "end": 83.88,
          "en": "And this Gameboard variable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 83.88,
          "end": 86.67,
          "en": "initially is simply our initial gameboard",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 86.67,
          "end": 89.40299999999999,
          "en": "because that initial structure does not change.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 91.23,
          "end": 93.75,
          "en": "But then we wanna overwrite this variable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 93.75,
          "end": 98.75,
          "en": "with data derived from our turns, if we have turns.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 98.88,
          "end": 101.61,
          "en": "On the other hand, if turns is an MTRA,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 101.61,
          "end": 104.43299999999999,
          "en": "we of course wanna leave the game board as it is.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 105.78,
          "end": 107.49000000000001,
          "en": "Well for that to achieve this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 107.49000000000001,
          "end": 110.027,
          "en": "we can simply add a for loop here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 110.027,
          "end": 112.807,
          "en": "where we loop through our turns",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 112.807,
          "end": 117.807,
          "en": "with a for of loop like this for turns of turns.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 119.25,
          "end": 120.96,
          "en": "And if turns is an empty array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 120.96,
          "end": 125.55,
          "en": "this loop simply won't execute without us doing anything.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 125.55,
          "end": 128.04,
          "en": "That's simply how JavaScript behaves.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 128.04,
          "end": 132.12,
          "en": "And in that loop we wanna extract the information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 132.12,
          "end": 134.145,
          "en": "about the turn that occurred",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 134.145,
          "end": 138.6,
          "en": "from that object that we're storing in this turns array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 138.6,
          "end": 140.94,
          "en": "Every turn in that turns array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 140.94,
          "end": 143.4,
          "en": "will be an object of this shape.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 143.4,
          "end": 146.04,
          "en": "So an object that has a square property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 146.04,
          "end": 149.28,
          "en": "which then holds some nested object as a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 149.28,
          "end": 152.01,
          "en": "and a player property which holds the symbol",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 152.01,
          "end": 154.293,
          "en": "of the active player as a value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 155.91,
          "end": 159.48,
          "en": "So here in GameBoard, we can now destructure our turn",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 159.48,
          "end": 163.953,
          "en": "to pull these two properties, square and player,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 165.15,
          "end": 168.12,
          "en": "so square and player,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 168.12,
          "end": 172.14,
          "en": "these two properties to pull them out of the turn.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 172.14,
          "end": 174.72,
          "en": "We're currently looking at in this iteration",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 174.72,
          "end": 177.933,
          "en": "of this loop, simply with this syntax here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 180.33,
          "end": 182.01,
          "en": "Now a square as just mentioned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 182.01,
          "end": 184.02,
          "en": "is then such a nested object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 184.02,
          "end": 188.103,
          "en": "where we have a row and a col property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 189.09,
          "end": 192.963,
          "en": "So we can pull this information out of this object as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 195.51,
          "end": 200.51,
          "en": "So here we got row and col from square.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 202.14,
          "end": 206.61,
          "en": "So we are performing object destructuring twice here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 206.61,
          "end": 208.95,
          "en": "But with that we then got the player symbol",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 208.95,
          "end": 212.853,
          "en": "and the row and column that was selected by that player.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 214.92000000000002,
          "end": 218.56,
          "en": "And therefore now of course we can go to our game board here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 221.16,
          "end": 226.16,
          "en": "and update the row and column with the player symbol.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 227.91,
          "end": 229.32,
          "en": "And that's all.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 229.32,
          "end": 232.41,
          "en": "We don't need to manage any state here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 232.41,
          "end": 237.41,
          "en": "Instead what we're doing here is called deriving state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 237.57,
          "end": 242.57,
          "en": "We are producing some derived state, some computed value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 243.15,
          "end": 247.47,
          "en": "you could say, Gameboard is a computed value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 247.47,
          "end": 250.53,
          "en": "that is derived from some state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 250.53,
          "end": 253.35,
          "en": "In this case, from the game turns state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 253.35,
          "end": 255.603,
          "en": "that is managed in the app component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 256.98,
          "end": 260.28,
          "en": "We are deriving the gameboard from that state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 260.28,
          "end": 265.28,
          "en": "And this is how you should think and work in React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 265.32,
          "end": 268.669,
          "en": "You should manage as little state as needed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 268.669,
          "end": 272.15999999999997,
          "en": "and try to derive as much information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 272.15999999999997,
          "end": 276.63,
          "en": "and as many values as possible from that state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 276.63,
          "end": 280.08,
          "en": "And so with that, if we save everything here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 280.08,
          "end": 282.06,
          "en": "if we reload our app here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 282.06,
          "end": 286.44,
          "en": "and we click a button, we see nothing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 286.44,
          "end": 288.3,
          "en": "The game board disappears.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 288.3,
          "end": 292.293,
          "en": "And if we open the developer tools, we'll see an error here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 293.15999999999997,
          "end": 296.90999999999997,
          "en": "cannot set properties of undefined.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 296.90999999999997,
          "end": 301.91,
          "en": "It occurs in the game board in line 14 as it seems.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 303.09,
          "end": 308.09,
          "en": "So this line here is failing, but why is it failing?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 308.22,
          "end": 310.56,
          "en": "Well, let's take a step back.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 310.56,
          "end": 314.76,
          "en": "We're deriving our game board based on the game turns.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 314.76,
          "end": 316.89300000000003,
          "en": "So let's take a look at those game turns.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 317.73,
          "end": 320.37,
          "en": "The game turns state is updated here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 320.37,
          "end": 322.5,
          "en": "and there we are storing information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 322.5,
          "end": 326.67,
          "en": "about the selected row with row index and call index.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 326.67,
          "end": 328.29,
          "en": "Which is data we're getting here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 328.29,
          "end": 331.89,
          "en": "as input to the handle select square function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 331.89,
          "end": 334.803,
          "en": "But where is this handle select square function called?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 336.09000000000003,
          "end": 338.15999999999997,
          "en": "Well it's passed as a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 338.15999999999997,
          "end": 341.793,
          "en": "through the on select square prop to Gameboard.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 342.84000000000003,
          "end": 344.8,
          "en": "And there this prop is in the end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 345.823,
          "end": 347.173,
          "en": "set as a value on On Click.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 348.33,
          "end": 353.33,
          "en": "But on click does not give us this row and call index data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 355.32,
          "end": 357.27,
          "en": "And that's the problem here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 357.27,
          "end": 361.14,
          "en": "To make sure that we get this information about which button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 361.14,
          "end": 363.69,
          "en": "in which row and which column was clicked,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 363.69,
          "end": 365.82,
          "en": "we should again use this approach here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 365.82,
          "end": 369.75,
          "en": "where we create an anonymous function that we pass",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 369.75,
          "end": 372.747,
          "en": "to on click so that we got full control",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 372.747,
          "end": 376.74,
          "en": "over how On Select Square will be executed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 376.74,
          "end": 381.33299999999997,
          "en": "So how handle select square in the end will be executed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 382.32,
          "end": 384.87,
          "en": "And here we can now pass our row index",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 384.87,
          "end": 388.62,
          "en": "and our col index as arguments to this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 388.62,
          "end": 391.23,
          "en": "and therefore in the end to this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 391.23,
          "end": 394.653,
          "en": "since that's the value for this on select square prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 395.79,
          "end": 397.40999999999997,
          "en": "And with that we're making sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 397.40999999999997,
          "end": 400.62,
          "en": "that this data arrives here and is stored here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 400.62,
          "end": 402.87,
          "en": "And with that, if we now reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 402.87,
          "end": 407.87,
          "en": "we can click these buttons and now the game board updates",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 407.88,
          "end": 410.4,
          "en": "we can still click the same button multiple times",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 410.4,
          "end": 412.08,
          "en": "but we'll fix this soon.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 412.08,
          "end": 414.738,
          "en": "But now we're updating this game state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 414.738,
          "end": 417.189,
          "en": "based on this game turns state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 417.189,
          "end": 420.57,
          "en": "by having this computed value here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 420.57,
          "end": 423.753,
          "en": "this derived state in the game board component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 424.89,
          "end": 427.553,
          "en": "And now we can of course also use this game turn state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 427.553,
          "end": 430.44,
          "en": "to output it in our log.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 430.44,
          "end": 433.039,
          "en": "And that's definitely a nice practice for you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 433.039,
          "end": 437.85,
          "en": "to pass this stage to the log and output it as a list there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 437.85,
          "end": 440.343,
          "en": "We will do it together in the next lecture.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}